{
  "slug": "prompt-smith",
  "name": "Prompt Smith",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Prompt Smith adds the /prompt slash command to Claude Code. It takes a rough prompt and rewrites it for clarity, structure, and precision — then shows a side-by-side preview before execution. Four optimization modes (default, agentic, compact, strict) adapt the rewrite to the prompt's intent. Supports --dry-run for preview-only, --yes to skip confirmation, and --mode to select explicitly.  Fidelity first: the optimized prompt always preserves the user's exact intent.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 command**, `prompt` ([Prompt Smith] Optimize Prompt).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install prompt-smith@claude-community` from `maxencemeloni/claude-code-prompt-smith`.\n\nPrompt Smith takes a rough prompt and optimizes it for Claude Code execution:\n\nPrompt Smith adds the /prompt slash command to Claude Code. It takes a rough prompt and rewrites it for clarity, structure, and precision — then shows a side-by-side preview before execution. Four optimization modes (default, agentic, compact, strict) adapt the rewrite to the prompt's intent. Supports --dry-run for preview-only, --yes to skip confirmation, and --mode to select explicitly.  Fidelity first: the optimized prompt always preserves the user's exact intent.",
